# Needs the dev test stock (TST). UI only: changes the player's monitor settings and puts them back.
name the Stock Monitor gear opens its settings: opacity slider, compact rows, sparklines, change in currency, hide a stock
monitor remember
monitor close
monitor open
click FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorSettings
wait 1
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorSettingsPanel
expect-text FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorSettingsTitle Stock Monitor settings
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorShow-TST
expect-no-overflow FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorSettingsPanel
hover FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorOpacityTrack 0.5 0.5
click FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorOpacityTrack
expect-text-is FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorOpacityValue 45%
capture stock-monitor-settings
click FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorOpt-Compact
click FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorOpt-ChangeCurrency
wait 1
expect-text FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorChange-TST ₡
expect-no-overflow FinanceOverhaulStockMonitor
capture stock-monitor-compact
click FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorShow-TST
wait 1
expect-hidden FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorRow-TST
click FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorShow-TST
wait 1
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorRow-TST
click FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorChange-TST
wait 1
expect-text FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorChange-TST %
cleanup:
hover off
click FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorSettings
monitor close
monitor restore
